					"nextDialogs": [
						721411204
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721411204,
					"content": "「彼」は不機嫌だ、「彼」が怒り出すぞ！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721411205,
						721411206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鷲津"
				},
				{
					"id": 721411205,
					"content": "何…？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721411207
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721411207,
					"content": "なぜだ！あの女のせいだ！あの褒美を拒否した邪悪なる者！邪悪なる者め！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721411208,
						721411209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鷲津"
				},
				{
					"id": 721411208,
					"content": "女…？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721411210
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721411210,
					"content": "彼女が逃げてる、でも「彼」からは逃げられない！十八の赤目！何千もの鋭い毒牙！いつも血を求めている、その無数の口と舌！！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721411211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鷲津"
				},
				{
					"id": 721411211,
					"content": "彼女は逃げられない、逃げられないのだ！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721411212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鷲津"
				},
				{
					"id": 721411212,
					"content": "ああ、無情な砂の国も、雨林の中に潜む知恵者を自称する愚かな物乞いも、誰も彼女を庇えはしないのだ！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721411213,
						721411214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "鷲津"
				},
				{
					"id": 721411213,
					"content": "落ち着いて！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721411215
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721411215,
					"content": "お前は褒美をもらったのだから、早く参拝に行け！参拝に行くのだ！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "鷲津"
				},
				{
					"id": 721411214,
					"content": "おお、よく言った！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721411215
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721411209,
					"content": "ああッ、なんてことだ！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721411210
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721411206,
					"content": "おおっ、怒り出すぞ！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721411207
					]
				},
